{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もブログを読みに来てくれてありがとうᡣ𐭩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは....\n先日、40thシングルの選抜発表がありました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんご存知の通り\n同期のみつきと矢田ちゃんがWセンターに抜擢されました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当におめでとう!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人の名前が呼ばれた瞬間、\n嬉しくて自然と笑みがこぼれていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "研修時代から一緒に頑張ってきた2人だから余計嬉しかったのかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これから色々な感情が2人の前に立ちはだかるかもしれないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同期として近くで支えられたらいいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ頼ってもらえるくらい全然しっかりしてないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も自分に出来ることを頑張ります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何かあったらいつでも\nりおの所に来てね☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハッピースマイル届けちゃうんだからっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⋆͛📢⋆お知らせ⋆͛📢⋆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂工事中\n｢乃木坂46 いい旅選手権 後編｣が配信中です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな休みを過ごしたかもうすこーし詳しくシェアするよん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/moblqPMRB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こぼれいくらねᡣ𐭩\n北海道のいくらはやっぱり絶品なのです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "超幸せでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次帰省する時は小樽で海鮮食べたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobDnEwTL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "地元の友達にも会って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobfXjdtP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "野球観戦にも行きました⚾︎\nこれからも応援してます💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方のお話を聞いていると\nひとり旅って良いなと熟熟思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は気づけばひとり旅のvlogを観ています♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もいつか世界を飛び回りたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はすっかり寒くなって季節の移り変わりを感じます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どれだけ好きでも夏はいつか終わる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の夏にやり残した事を秋の風と共に思い出しても"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年の夏、叶ればいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう思う"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど人は違う"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今一緒に活動出来ている空間も時間も\nいつもそばにあるから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "当たり前だと思ってしまうけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それは\n永遠に続くものでもなければ\n季節みたいに戻ってくるものでもない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから今を大切に過ごします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日皆さんに会えるのを楽しみにしています!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}